Why Android TV suits IPTV better than most platforms"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 max-w-3xl text-base leading-7 text-slate-600","children":"The difference is not raw power. It is that Android TV was built around the same things live television needs: a remote, a channel list, and apps that are allowed to exist."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-8 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2","children":[["$","article","Players install from the Play Store",{"className":"rounded-[1.5rem] border border-slate-200 bg-gradient-to-br from-white to-slate-50 p-6 shadow-[0_20px_60px_-45px_rgba(15,23,42,0.5)]","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900","children":"Players install from the Play Store"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600","children":"No sideloading, no unknown-sources toggle, no Downloader codes. Search, install, sign in. Updates arrive automatically like any other app."}]]}],["$","article","The remote maps onto live TV",{"className":"rounded-[1.5rem] border border-slate-200 bg-gradient-to-br from-white to-slate-50 p-6 shadow-[0_20px_60px_-45px_rgba(15,23,42,0.5)]","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900","children":"The remote maps onto live TV"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600","children":"A directional pad, back button and dedicated number or channel keys are exactly what a programme guide expects. Navigating a thousand channels with a phone-style interface is miserable; with a proper remote it is not."}]]}],["$","article","It handles big channel lists",{"className":"rounded-[1.5rem] border border-slate-200 bg-gradient-to-br from-white to-slate-50 p-6 shadow-[0_20px_60px_-45px_rgba(15,23,42,0.5)]","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900","children":"It handles big channel lists"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600","children":"Most Android TV devices have enough memory to h