roblems on Android TV"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 max-w-3xl text-base leading-7 text-slate-600","children":"Android TV problems are usually storage, network, or the app cache rather than the stream. Work through these before changing anything else."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-8 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3","children":[["$","article","Menus have become slow",{"className":"rounded-[1.5rem] border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"inline-flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-slate-900 text-xs font-bold text-white","children":1}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-base font-bold text-slate-900","children":"Menus have become slow"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600","children":"Programme guide data builds up over weeks. Go to Settings → Apps → your player → Clear cache. Do not clear data, as that removes your login. Menus usually snap back to normal straight away."}]]}],["$","article","Storage is full",{"className":"rounded-[1.5rem] border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"inline-flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-slate-900 text-xs font-bold text-white","children":2}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-base font-bold text-slate-900","children":"Storage is full"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600","children":"Cheaper boxes and Chromecast have very little internal space, and a full device stutters everywhere. Uninstall apps you never open, then clear caches. Keeping a couple of gigabytes free makes a visible difference."}]]}],["$","article","Buffering on Wi-Fi only",{"className":"rounded-[1.5rem] border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"inline-flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-slate-900 text-xs font-bold text-white","children":3}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-base font-bold text-slate-900","children":"Buffering on Wi-Fi only"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600","children":"Move to the 5 GHz band, or use an Ethernet adapter if your device supports one. If the same channel plays cleanly on a laptop nearby, the network path to your TV is the problem rather than the service."}]]}],["$","article","The app will not install",{"className":"rounded-[1.5rem] border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"inline-flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-slate-900 text-xs font-bold text-white","children":4}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-base font-bold text-slate-900","children":"The app will not install"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600","children":"If the Play Store cannot find the player, your device may not be Google certified. Check Settings → About for Play Protect certification. Uncertified boxes need a different install route — message us and we will talk you through it."}]]}],["$","article","One channel fails, the rest are fine",{"className":"rounded-[1.5rem] border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"inline-flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-slate-900 text-xs font-bold text-white","children":5}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-base font-bold text-slate-900","children":"One channel fails, the rest are fine"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600","children":"That is the source, not your setup. Note the channel name and send it to us rather than reinstalling anything."}]]}],["$","article","Everything stopped after an update",{"className":"rounded-[1.5rem] border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"inline-flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-slate-900 text-xs font-bold text-white","children":6}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-base font-bold text-slate-900","children":"Everything stopped after an update"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600","children":"Occasionally a system update resets app permissions or network settings. Restart the device fully — power off at the plug for thirty seconds rather than just standby — then reopen the player."}]]}]]}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"id":"faq","className":"scroll-mt-24 bg-white py-14 sm:py-20","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"mx-auto w-full max-w-6xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-4xl","children":"IPTV on Android TV: frequently asked questions"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-8 space-y-3","children":[["$","details","Which IPTV app is best for Android TV?",{"className":"group rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-5","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900 sm:text-base","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"Which IPTV app is best for Android TV?"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"text-lg text-slate-400 transition group-open:rotate-45","children":"+"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 border-t border-slate-200 pt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600","children":"We recommend and support IBO Player, which installs from the Play Store and lets us add your playlist from our end so you never type a long server address with a remote. TiViMate is the other popular choice and is widely regarded as the best-looking Android TV player, though its premium features are a paid upgrade."}]]}],["$","details","Does IPTV work on Google TV?",{"className":"group rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-5","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900 sm:text-base","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"Does IPTV work on Google TV?"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"text-lg text-slate-400 transition group-open:rotate-45","children":"+"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 border-t border-slate-200 pt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600","children":"Yes. Google TV is Android TV with a different interface on top, so the same players install from the same Play Store. Chromecast with Google TV, and Sony and TCL sets running Google TV, all work."}]]}],["$","details","Will it work on my Sony or Philips Android TV?",{"className":"group rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-5","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900 sm:text-base","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"Will it work on my Sony or Philips Android TV?"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"text-lg text-slate-400 transition group-open:rotate-45","children":"+"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 border-t border-slate-200 pt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600","children":"Yes, if the television runs Android TV or Google TV, which most recent Sony, Philips, TCL and Hisense sets do. You install the player directly on the TV with no extra box. Older models can feel slower with very large channel lists."}]]}],["$","details","Do I need to sideload anything on Android TV?",{"className":"group rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-5","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900 sm:text-base","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"Do I need to sideload anything on Android TV?"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"text-lg text-slate-400 transition group-open:rotate-45","children":"+"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 border-t border-slate-200 pt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600","children":"Not on a Google certified device. Everything installs from the Play Store like a normal app. Sideloading is only needed on uncertified boxes that cannot access the Play Store, and we will walk you through it if that applies to yours."}]]}],["$","details","Can I watch 4K on Android TV?",{"className":"group rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-5","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900 sm:text-base","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"Can I watch 4K on Android TV?"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"text-lg text-slate-400 transition group-open:rotate-45","children":"+"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 border-t border-slate-200 pt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600","children":"Yes, where the channel is broadcast in 4K and your device and television both support it. You will want around 25 Mbps of steady bandwidth. A 4K-capable box on a 1080p television will still play the stream, just downscaled."}]]}],["$","details","What is the difference between Android TV and an Android box?",{"className":"group rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-5","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900 sm:text-base","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"What is the difference between Android TV and an Android box?"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"text-lg text-slate-400 transition group-open:rotate-45","children":"+"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 border-t border-slate-200 pt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600","children":"Android TV and Google TV are Google-certified builds designed for televisions, with the Play Store and licensed Google services. Customised Android boxes run their own launchers and app stores, and often add recording tools or extra storage instead. Our Android TV box guide compares the main models sold in the UK."}]]}],["$","details","Why has my Android TV become slow?",{"className":"group rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-5","childre